<title>USA: Kansas City, Mo., $40 mln GO bonds won by Goldman.</title>
<headline>Kansas City, Mo., $40 mln GO bonds won by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it won $40 million of Kansas City, Mo., general obligation bonds, Series 1997B, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.021 percent.</p>
</text>
